The existing addressable FCI fire alarm control panel (model no. GWIF602SS-198R) is approximately 22 years old. The manufacturer has released a Products Retirement Notice stating that they have stopped producing this panel and its replacement parts. The panel has reached the end of its expected lifespan. It shall be replaced, in kind, with a new addressable Honeywell Gamewell FCI E3 Series fire alarm control panel.
